{0 ohttp-cohttp}

Conversions between the messages of the [http] package, which cohttp,
cohttp-lwt, and cohttp-eio share, and those of [bhttp], with the routing of a
gateway's resources and of its targets. [ohttp-cohttp-lwt] and
[ohttp-cohttp-eio] are built on it.

{!modules: Ohttp_cohttp}

See the {{:https://github.com/thevilledev/ocaml-ohttp/blob/main/doc/http-libraries.md}HTTP libraries}
guide.
